==Holiday events==
* He played a minor role in the [[2016 Birthday event]], where he witnessed a seagull take a [[gnome child]]'s [[hat]]. 
* In the [[2018 Christmas event]], where he was one of the recipients of a gift from Duke Horacio. He is given a [[Chair (Hans)|chair]] from the Duke's room, which he takes in relief, having spent many years circling the castle without relief.{{CiteNPC |npc=Hans |quote=Oh my aching feet! A chair! Just what I've been needing! I'm going to go sit by the fountain, so pretty this time of year. |loc=2018 Christmas event }}{{CiteNPC |npc=Account{{!}}Player character |quote=I reckon Hans could do with a sit down as he's always on his feet. |loc=2018 Christmas event }}
* In the [[20th Anniversary event]], he gives his navigational chart to the gnome child to help the latter return to the [[Realm of Memories]].
* In the [[2022 Birthday event]], a [[Hans (2022 Birthday event)|variant]] of Hans was one of the participants in the cook off hosted by [[My Arm]].

