==Trivia==
*[[Jagex]] claims that Hans was the first [[non-player character]] created in ''RuneScape''.{{CiteNews |author = Mod Chris L|url = http://services.runescape.com/m=news/capes-of-distinction|title = Capes of Distinction|newsdate = 3 May 2011}} However, this is likely untrue. [[Bob]] appears earlier in ''[[RuneScape Classic]]''{{'}}s data files, and is visible in pre-release screenshots, while Hans is not. It is possible that Hans was the first NPC added by [[Paul Gower]], while Bob was added by [[Andrew Gower]]. [[Unicorn]] appears first overall, but is non-human and cannot really be considered a "character".
*When [[Retreat|retreating]] after getting scared by the player, he can be lured out of the castle walls as far as the entrance of the [[H.A.M. Hideout]].
*Hans may be a pun about time, as his name resembles "hands" (as in the hands of a clock), he tells you how much time you've spent in RuneScape, and his walking pattern around Lumbridge castle goes clockwise and takes him exactly 1 minute to complete a lap, like the second hand of a clock.
*Hans had a festive override wearing a [[santa hat]] during the [[2023 Christmas event/Gallery|2023]], [[2024 Christmas event/Gallery|2024]], and [[2025 Christmas event/Gallery|2025]] Christmas events.

